<title>POLAND: Swarzedz revises down 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Swarzedz revises down 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swarzedz SA results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						  1996	  1995</p>
<p>    operating loss			  24.56 vs   13.29 profit</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			    39.35 vs    3.00 profit</p>
<p>    net loss				  39.46 vs    1.19 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Swarzedzkie Fabryki Mebli SA. Earlier the company reported a net loss of 38.9 million zlotys and operating loss of 24 million zlotys. @</p>
<p>    net sales				106.89 vs  101.30</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  89.68 vs   74.68</p>
<p>    extraordinary			    0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.11 vs    1.81</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     1.18 vs    1.01</p>
<p>    financial costs			 16.21 vs   11.50</p>
<p>    investment				 0.00 vs    7.74</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
